## User Stories

1. As a Learner I want to register account and be able to access the Learner dashboard.
2. As a Learner I want to create, view my tasks and be able to track my progress.
3. As a Learner I want to book and view my support sessions, so that I don't miss them.
4. As a Learner I want to make goal records and view them on the learner dashboard.
6. As a Learner I want to play a mini game.
6. As an Assessor I want to view bookings and update their statuses.
7. As an Assessor I want to view learner tasks and progress.
8. As an Assessor I want to be able to upload learning materials on the dashboard.

## Acceptance Criteria

1. As a Learner I want to register account and be able to access the Learner dashboard.
# Acceptance Criteria
- A Register page is displayed when the learner selects the Register button.
- The learner can enter their first name.
- The learner can enter their surname.
- The learner can enter a valid email address.
- The learner can create a password.
- The learner can confirm their password.
- The learner must complete all required fields before registering.
- The system validates that the email address is in a valid format.
- The system checks that the password and confirmation password match.
- The system prevents registration when an account with the same email address already exists.
- A successful registration message is displayed after the account is created.
- The learner can log in using their registered email address and password.
- Invalid login details display an appropriate error message.
- After successful login, the learner is redirected to the Learner Dashboard.
- The Learner Dashboard displays the learner's relevant information and available features.
- The learner can log out of the dashboard successfully.
- After logging out, the learner cannot access the Learner Dashboard without logging in again.

2. As a Learner I want to create, view my tasks and be able to track my progress.
# Acceptance Criteria
- A Create task page is displayed after clicking New Task button.
- The learner can enter a task title,task description,task status.
- The learner can save a new task by clicking the Save Task button.
- A message is displayed when the task is successfully created or appropriate error message.
- The learner can view all their existing tasks.
- The learner can update the status of a task.
- The learner can see their overall task progress on the dashboard.
 
3. As a Learner I want to book and view my support sessions, so that I don't miss them.
# Acceptance Criteria
- A Support Sessions page is displayed when the learner click sessions button.
- The learner can view available support sessions.
- Each session displays the date, time, assessor and session details.
- The learner can select an available session.
- A message is displayed after a successful booking.
- The booked session appears in the learner's My Sessions section.

4. As a Learner I want to make goal record and view them on the learner dashboard.
# Acceptance Criteria
- A Goals page is displayed after clicking Goals button on the learner dashboard.
- The learner can click Add Goal to create a new goal.
- The learner can enter a goal title, goal description & goal date.
- A message is displayed after the goal is successfully saved by the save button.
- The learner can view all their saved goals.
- The learner can update the status of a goal.

6. As a Learner I want to play a mini game.
# Acceptance Criteria
- A Mini Game option is available on the learner dashboard.
- The learner can launch the mini game.
- The game displays clear instructions before the learner starts.
- The learner can play the game.
- The learner receives a score after completing the game.
- The learner can restart or play the game again.

6. As an Assessor I want to view bookings and update their statuses.
# Acceptance Criteria
- An Assessor Bookings page is available on the assessor dashboard.
- The assessor can view all learner bookings.
- Each booking displays the learner name, session date, time, and session details.
- The assessor can view the current booking status.
- The assessor can update the booking status.
- Available statuses include Pending, Confirmed, Completed, and Cancelled.
- The updated status is immediately displayed in the booking list.
- Learners can see the updated booking status.

7. As an Assessor I want to view learner tasks and progress.
# Acceptance Criteria
- A Learner Progress section is available on the assessor dashboard.
- The assessor can view a list of learners.
- The assessor can select a learner to view their tasks.
- The assessor can view the status of each task.
- The assessor can view the learner's overall task progress.
- Task progress is updated when the learner changes their task status.

8. As an Assessor I want to be able to upload learning materials on the dashboard.
# Acceptance Criteria
- An Upload Learning Material option is available on the assessor dashboard.
- The assessor can select a file from their device.
- The assessor can enter a material title.
- The assessor can enter a description for the material.
- The assessor can upload supported file types.
- A message is displayed after a successful upload.
- The uploaded material appears in the learning materials section.
- Learners can view or download materials made available to them.
- The assessor can view, update & delete previously uploaded materials.
